«
@@ ============================================================
@@ LLtoUTM — latitude and longitude on the WGS-84 ellipsoid to Universal
@@ Transverse Mercator coordinates. Krüger series in the form of
@@ C. F. F. Karney, Journal of Geodesy 85 (2011), to order 4; zones as in
@@ NGA.SIG.0012 (2014), with the exceptions of Norway and Svalbard.
@@
@@ Input : φ λ — latitude from 80°S to 84°N, longitude (East positive).
@@         Plain numbers are degrees; angles with a unit are accepted.
@@ Output: zone hemisphere E N — zone 1 to 60, "N" or "S", easting and
@@         northing in metres.
@@ Angle mode and angle units setting are restored before returning.
@@ ============================================================

  2 →LIST
  « IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN 1_° CONVERT UVAL END →Num »
  MAP LIST→ DROP
  → lat lon
  «
    IF lat -80 < lat 84 > OR THEN
      "UTM needs a latitude from 80°S to 84°N" DOERR
    END
    lon 180 + 360 MOD 180 -
    → lam
    «
      lam 180 + 6 / FLOOR 1 +
      IF lat 56 ≥ lat 64 < AND lam 3 ≥ AND lam 12 < AND THEN DROP 32 END
      IF lat 72 ≥ lam 0 ≥ AND lam 42 < AND THEN
        DROP lam 9 < 31 « lam 21 < 33 « lam 33 < 35 37 IFTE » IFTE » IFTE EVAL
      END
      R→I
      'AngleMode' RCL 'SetAngleUnits' RCL
      RAD NoAngleUnits
      Ⓒe12♁GPS →Num √ Ⓒπ →Num 180 /
      → zon amode aunits ecc rdn
      «
        'lat*rdn' EVAL '(lam-(6*zon-183))*rdn' EVAL
        → phi dlm
        «
          'TAN(phi)' EVAL 'SINH(ecc*ATANH(ecc*SIN(phi)))' EVAL
          → tph sph
          «
            'tph*√(1+sph²)-sph*√(1+tph²)' EVAL
            → tcf
            «
              'ATAN(tcf/COS(dlm))' EVAL 'ASINH(SIN(dlm)/√(tcf²+COS(dlm)²))' EVAL
              → xi eta
              «
                zon
                lat 0 ≥ "N" "S" IFTE
                '500000+6.36490216616508551E+06*(eta+8.37731820624469832E-4*COS(2*xi)*SINH(2*eta)+7.60852777380208316E-7*COS(4*xi)*SINH(4*eta)+1.19764548261874486E-9*COS(6*xi)*SINH(6*eta)+2.42915021301519471E-12*COS(8*xi)*SINH(8*eta))' EVAL 1_m *
                '6.36490216616508551E+06*(xi+8.37731820624469832E-4*SIN(2*xi)*COSH(2*eta)+7.60852777380208316E-7*SIN(4*xi)*COSH(4*eta)+1.19764548261874486E-9*SIN(6*xi)*COSH(6*eta)+2.42915021301519471E-12*SIN(8*xi)*COSH(8*eta))' EVAL
                IF lat 0 < THEN 10000000 + END 1_m *
              »
            »
          »
        »
        amode EVAL IF aunits THEN SetAngleUnits ELSE NoAngleUnits END
      »
    »
  »
»
